00:36:40,932 --> 00:36:49,056
[SPEAKER_02]: As Jeff Heath said one time, I was interviewed on a ballpark.

632
00:36:50,256 --> 00:36:55,098
[SPEAKER_02]: I think it was the World Series, in 1954 here.

633
00:36:55,819 --> 00:36:57,019
[SPEAKER_02]: He came back from the coast.

