635
00:37:03,342 --> 00:37:05,022
[SPEAKER_02]: Jeff overheard him and he was walking by.

636
00:37:05,803 --> 00:37:08,704
[SPEAKER_02]: He said, that son of a gun wouldn't give his mother a good ball of head.

637
00:37:09,831 --> 00:37:15,595
[SPEAKER_02]: I said, come on, Jeff, I gave you a lot of good work to hit.

638
00:37:15,635 --> 00:37:20,377
[SPEAKER_02]: He says, yeah, what the hell are you?

639
00:37:20,597 --> 00:37:21,918
[SPEAKER_01]: Were you with the team then?

640
00:37:22,418 --> 00:37:23,679
