641
00:37:23,699 --> 00:37:24,920
[SPEAKER_01]: I was in charge of personnel.

642
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:28,902
[SPEAKER_01]: How did you come back to, how did you get on the Cleveland organization?

643
00:37:31,283 --> 00:37:32,904
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, Hank Greenberg come here, you know.

644
00:37:34,445 --> 00:37:36,586
[SPEAKER_02]: And he and Ralph Conner were pretty good friends.

645
00:37:37,367 --> 00:37:38,207
[SPEAKER_02]: I knew Ralph Conner.

646
00:37:39,342 --> 00:37:42,424
[SPEAKER_02]: Ralph says, how would you like to work for Anne Greenberg?

647
00:37:42,485 --> 00:37:43,245
[SPEAKER_02]: I said, I don't care.

648
00:37:46,488 --> 00:37:47,588
[SPEAKER_02]: So I never thought no more of it.

649
00:37:49,070 --> 00:37:50,431
[SPEAKER_02]: One day I got a call from Greenberg.

650
00:37:51,972 --> 00:37:55,074
[SPEAKER_02]: Said, it's Anne Greenberg, and I'd like to work for her.

651
00:37:55,154 --> 00:37:55,715
[SPEAKER_02]: I said, OK.

652
00:37:57,436 --> 00:37:58,757
[SPEAKER_02]: So I made a date on the beach.

653
00:38:03,821 --> 00:38:05,562
[SPEAKER_01]: Were you living in Florida then?

654
00:38:05,582 --> 00:38:05,662
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

655
00:38:06,063 --> 00:38:07,644
[SPEAKER_01]: Where were you making your regular home?

656
00:38:08,289 --> 00:38:08,809
[SPEAKER_01]: California.

657
00:38:09,109 --> 00:38:09,549
[SPEAKER_01]: I see.

658
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,351
[SPEAKER_01]: So that's when you came here.

659
00:38:16,131 --> 00:38:17,152
[SPEAKER_02]: That's how we wound up here.

660
