[SPEAKER_02]: It was like Cleveland anyway.

661
00:38:22,773 --> 00:38:30,515
[SPEAKER_02]: It was a beautiful city, you know, this time of year in the summer.

662
00:38:30,535 --> 00:38:34,556
[SPEAKER_01]: What was your last year in professional ball?

