678
00:39:15,663 --> 00:39:16,644
[SPEAKER_02]: Used to play well, huh?

679
00:39:16,924 --> 00:39:18,305
[SPEAKER_02]: Kids ask you that, you know.

680
00:39:19,166 --> 00:39:20,527
[SPEAKER_02]: I get so many autographs.

681
00:39:22,048 --> 00:39:23,789
