682
00:39:23,809 --> 00:39:27,112
[SPEAKER_02]: They always want to know, what's your biggest thrill?

683
00:39:31,635 --> 00:39:33,997
[SPEAKER_02]: Of course, if I had the time, I'd feel good that day.

684
00:39:34,097 --> 00:39:35,278
[SPEAKER_02]: I'd rather know what you know.

685
00:39:36,179 --> 00:39:37,760
[SPEAKER_02]: So my biggest thrill was signing you up.

686
00:39:39,695 --> 00:39:43,918
[SPEAKER_02]: professional contract, getting the professional ball.

687
00:39:44,018 --> 00:39:46,359
