696
00:40:13,688 --> 00:40:16,209
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, yeah.

697
00:40:16,229 --> 00:40:17,529
[SPEAKER_02]: Big good drink of course, hot chocolate.

698
00:40:21,951 --> 00:40:24,572
[SPEAKER_01]: And after a game or in the evening, you know?

699
00:40:24,632 --> 00:40:24,832
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

700
00:40:25,212 --> 00:40:26,953
[SPEAKER_01]: And would he be ready the next day?

701
00:40:27,714 --> 00:40:28,274
[SPEAKER_01]: He'd be ready.

702
00:40:29,134 --> 00:40:29,714
[SPEAKER_01]: Never bothered.

703
00:40:29,874 --> 00:40:32,616
[SPEAKER_01]: Never seen a guy with a hangover yet.

704
00:40:33,396 --> 00:40:35,697
