[SPEAKER_01]: How about Jake Powell?

763
00:43:56,145 --> 00:43:58,607
[SPEAKER_01]: Were you a teammate of his with the Yankees?

764
00:43:58,667 --> 00:44:00,608
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, he was with us for a while.

765
00:44:00,648 --> 00:44:05,272
[SPEAKER_01]: He had some attacks, I guess, with his bad nerve, I guess.

766
00:44:05,652 --> 00:44:08,754
[SPEAKER_01]: In fact, I think I saw him when he was walking having an attack on the field.

767
00:44:10,721 --> 00:44:11,761
