00:44:17,763 --> 00:44:18,283
[SPEAKER_02]: Yankees?

770
00:44:19,343 --> 00:44:21,604
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, he was with the Yankees.

771
00:44:21,624 --> 00:44:24,705
[SPEAKER_02]: Interviewed him one time and put him in there.

772
00:44:26,665 --> 00:44:28,486
[SPEAKER_02]: The guy asked him, what do you do in the wintertime?

