775
00:44:33,247 --> 00:44:36,768
[SPEAKER_02]: He said, and hit these niggers over the head with clubs.

776
00:44:38,907 --> 00:44:42,690
[SPEAKER_02]: And I guess they heard about this, all the colored people.

777
00:44:42,710 --> 00:44:47,053
[SPEAKER_01]: Boy, they come up there pretty strong on us.

778
00:44:47,073 --> 00:44:48,814
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, we went to Chicago from here.

779
00:44:49,695 --> 00:44:51,496
[SPEAKER_02]: Boy, it is right out there, all those colored people.

780
00:44:52,877 --> 00:44:53,898
[SPEAKER_01]: We need to give them hell.

781
00:44:58,481 --> 00:45:00,723
[SPEAKER_01]: Did you ever play against any black players at all?

782
00:45:01,163 --> 00:45:01,884
[SPEAKER_01]: Barnstorming?

783
00:45:01,924 --> 00:45:02,164
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

784
00:45:02,805 --> 00:45:05,366
[SPEAKER_01]: I didn't do much barnstorming.

785
00:45:05,386 --> 00:45:06,127
[SPEAKER_01]: Only once or twice.

786
00:45:11,661 --> 00:45:21,506
[SPEAKER_02]: Not too much money involved, I'll tell you that.

787
00:45:26,169 --> 00:45:33,673
